# LF in the repo and in every checkout, Windows included. A CR after a shebang fails systemd units
# with 203/EXEC and scripts with "bad interpreter", and bash -n and makepkg reject a CRLF PKGBUILD;
# Windows editors keep whatever line endings they read.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Patches keep their exact bytes: a patch to a CRLF file carries CRLF lines it must not lose.
*.patch -text
*.patch.disabled -text
